V, and finally won a role on the series Three's Company (1976). She married Hamel ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2023&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d18\"},\"ref\":\"d18\",\"snippet\":\" ... been blessed.\\\"\\n\\nThe actor soon left the series, but returned for the finale in 2015.\\n\\nJones, who earned a reported $350,000 per episode during his final season as a full-time cast member on the CBS sitcom, told Houston TV station KHOU that the show \\\"was making ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.eonline.com/photos/9198/child-stars-who-turned-out-all-right\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... Birney was best known for his roles on St. Elsewhere and Bridget Loves Bernie. Meredith Baxter was Birney's co-star on the latter TV series, and was married to the actor from 1974 to 1989. The pair shared three kids, Mollie, 37, Peter, 37, and Kate, 47 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.etonline.com/gallery/stars-weve-lost-in-2022-177426\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... One of her last roles was on the television series Matador (2014). She also found herself further down the credits in films such as On the Borderline (2001), Transamerica (2005), The Lost City (2005), Mother and Child (2009), The Perfect Family (2011), Plush (2013), and Grandma (2015). Three ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"