 | 42.5 | 89.2 | 72.0 |\\n\\n| PS+ (ours) | 91.8 | 59.3 | 92.2 | 46.0 | 94.7 | 75.7 |\\n\\n| Method | CSQA | StrategyQA |\\n\\n|---|---|---|\\n\\n| Few-Shot-CoT (Manual) | 78.3 | 71.2 |\\n\\n| Zero-shot-CoT | 65.2 | 63 ... \",\"title\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2501.04040v1\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"7febb712d5ab879b74000bd9b77f362105bd4afe04883e113e8cad03d3f09054\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"6b80625dc6e454b1bd98763c9e36f34b7d53f00dabaf4b7dc64fd49de583b004\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor height 1.65 1.70 plays real life relative series\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_975997f4bfdf4d12909e2b5f"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Aidy Bryant's Hulu series Shrill and in the 2019 film James vs. His Future Self. In 2023, he joined season 4 of Apple TV+'s critically acclaimed science fiction drama For All Mankind as the character Eli Hobson.\\n\\nHe and actress Laure Mattos have been married ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2003, Mulroney played Gavin Mitchell on the TV series Friends. He appeared in three episodes of the ninth season, his character briefly dating Rachel. This would mark Mulroney's last on-screen appearance on television for a number of years, later revealing in a May 2007 interview ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d32\"},\"ref\":\"d32\",\"snippet\":\" ... Every woman who gets involved with Nate Romanowski - the series' resident badass - meets an untimely end.\\n\\n- The Cat Who... Series: Supporting character Iris Cobb was married three times, and all three of her husbands predeceased her — her first one (and the father of her only son) died of ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CartwrightCurse\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... Macdonald went on to star in his three-season series Norm and continued to perform standup. He was also a frequent guest on late-night shows.\\n\\nMacdonald died in September 2021 after a private cancer battle. He was 61.\\n\\nMacdonald's last comedy special, Norm Macdonald: Nothing Special ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/saturday-night-live-stars-who-have-died-9257836\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... Personal life\\n\\nRomero was married three times. He married his first wife, Nancy, in 1971. They divorced in 1978. They had one child together, Cameron, who later became a filmmaker. \\n\\nRomero met his second wife, actress Christine Forrest, on the set of Season of the Witch (1972), and ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_A._Romero\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the early 1970s, she landed minor roles in film and TV, and finally won a role on the series Three's Company (1976). She married Hamel in 1977. She was fired from the series after she asked for a raise at the beginning of the fifth season ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2023&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... attack on August 12, 2014 in Santa Monica, California. She had battled breast cancer some years earlier. - Actress\\n\\n- Writer\\n\\n- Additional Crew\\n\\nShirley Temple was easily the most popular and famous child star of all time. She got her start in the movies at the age of three and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... In this season, Rapunzel is Lady Tremaine, the wicked stepmother to Cinderella.\\n\\nThe video of the song \\\"Circles\\\" by Post Malone is inspired by the story of Rapunzel.\\n\\nAnimated television media\\n\\nThe American television animated anthology series, Happily Ever After: Fairy Tales for Every Child (1995-2000), the ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rapunzel\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... During the series' run, he met actress Barbara Eden on a date arranged by the 20th Century-Fox publicity department; the two later married. He played the Klingon commander Kang on three Star Trek television series: Star Trek (1966), Star Trek: Deep Space Nine (1993) and Star Trek ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2013&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\"