MRI technician who goes on a blind date with Leslie. The ex-couple had previously acted together on Arnett's ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/things-fun-facts-you-didnt-know-about-parks-and-recreation\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... Once again, it was entirely unrelated to the stories cobbled together in the series; the film was largely derived from Megazone 23, a fantastic anime from director Macross director Noboru Ishiguro. For many viewers in the UK – your humble writer included – Robotech provided an early exposure to the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/tv/the-shows-films-that-made-britain-fall-in-love-with-anime/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d40\"},\"ref\":\"d40\",\"snippet\":\" ... Some players provide real world services (like website design, web hosting) paid for with in-game currency. This can influence the economy of the game, as players gain wealth/power in the game unrelated to game events. For example, this strategy is used in Blizzard Entertainment's World ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emergent_gameplay\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... In this one, his \\\"drunk husband\\\" bit was a masterpiece of timing and ingenuity.\\\"\\n\\nKen Tucker of Entertainment Weekly reviewed the series following its Blu-ray boxset release in 2012 writing, \\\"The Dick Van Dyke Show certainly wasn't the first sitcom featuring a lead character who presided ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dick_Van_Dyke\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d41\"},\"ref\":\"d41\",\"snippet\":\" ... The series is a balm for the soul and a reassurance in difficult times that love and goodness were not just real, but still attainable.—LH\\n\\nThe CBS All Access series, which picks up after the events in the final episode of the CBS series \\\"The Good Wife ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.indiewire.com/feature/best-tv-shows-decade-2010-2019-netflix-hbo-1202148573/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... Crowe will play the role of one of Kaczynski's Harvard professors, Henry Murray.\\n\\nRussell Crowe lands a featured role on Netflix's Unabom\\n\\nThe movie is based on real-life events, and Murray subjected Kaczynski to controversial psychological experiment, which likely led to his later-life actions ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3758542/news/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d8\"},\"ref\":\"d8\",\"snippet\":\" ... Domhnall and Brendan Gleeson\\n\\nDomhnall and Brendan Gleeson are Irish actors who portrayed completely unrelated characters. The father-son duo still share scenes together in the seventh movie.\\n\\nDomhnall played the role of Bill Weasley while Brendan (Domhnall's father) portrayed Professor Moody. Their one and only interaction ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.getsurrey.co.uk/whats-on/harry-potter-actors-who-family-20927308\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d43\"},\"ref\":\"d43\",\"snippet\":\" ... In three different remakes characters are shown to have different motivations that influence the storyline but the underlying message remains the same.\\n\\nTennessee Tuxedo And His Tales\\n\\nPremiered on September 28, 1963\\n\\nA penguin and a walrus might be very unlikely friends in real life (in the very ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.boredpanda.com/60s-cartoons/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d44\"},\"ref\":\"d44\",\"snippet\":\" ... On top of that, he's very over-the-top and cheesy, and as such, the actors have parodied that character in the comedy portions of later entries in the series. The actor who played, him, though, has returned for the 3rd, 5th, 6th, and 8th entries, as ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/PlotIrrelevantVillain\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f05b7b40280c57ccbfede3a6ea8fd3bca39010b991206e893349dbb4a3124143\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"41d09415789cd9906e21de6d26101de2b7d0eb981ceebacc98104c3b3a83cdcd\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"entertainer real life relative plays together series unrelated characters\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_0768f4ae82c7421fabefd270"},{"content":"The first search result (d1) is very promising — it mentions Jessica and Richard Harmon, siblings who play unrelated characters. Let me read that page, and also search for more specific information about the Harmon siblings and their show \"The 100.\"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d1\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_3cb7283aa154475e8d5a8736","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Richard Harmon The 100 height character married\", \"Jessica Harmon Richard Harmon siblings The 100 unrelated characters\", \"The 100 season started 2014 number of seasons\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_bd0a1eaf38b64440ae611374","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"evidence\":{\"document\":\"d1\",\"document_chars\":9101,\"end\":3000,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e1\",\"sha256\":\"30d6d8bd1feaa16d7480eae3bbb0d0772ddf0a956d9870efc705af2df5ace29e\",\"snapshot\":\"a531c0a6be82cbe578781b28cb207ff02e87008856d5212ec2eab3fae2afe076\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: Screen Rant\\nauthor: Joseph Allen\\ndate: 2018-04-13\\n---\\nThe CW's slate of programming is a fascinating one. Many of its shows are actually fairly well-regarded, whether they take place inside of the network's sprawling Arrowverse or not. Part of the reason these shows have been so successful is because of their excellent casting and captivating stars.\\n\\nAlthough the CW has a number of great shows on the air and a really great talent pool, they more than occasionally like to cast actors who are actually related to one another in real life, or are married and have decided to form a new family with one another.\\n\\nWhether these two relatives show up on the same show or not depends on the specifics of the situation, but as many of the couples on this list are married, it's often the case that the two of them met while they were filming together. Other times, the relationship between the two actors was the reason that one of them was brought onto a show.\\n\\nWhatever the reasons might be, it's clear that the CW has no fears about keeping things close. After all, if one actor from a family works out, who's to say that others won't, too?\\n\\nHere are 15 CW Stars That Only True Fans Know Are Actually Family.\\n\\nStephen And Robbie Amell\\n\\nThis one is among the most readily apparent on this list, in part because Robbie and Stephen Amell share a last name. The cousins have also made homes for themselves on the CW, where they have both played superheroes.\\n\\nStephen has been Oliver Queen on Arrow for several years, and Robbie has played Firestorm on The Flash. Robbie also played a teleporting hero on Tomorrow People, which has been off the air for a few years now.\\n\\nIn addition to sharing an employer, at least sometimes, the two cousins also look quite a bit alike, and are each quite handsome. Of course, there a number of families who have spawned multiple successful actors because, at the end of the day, part of the reason actors are famous is because of their looks, which the Amells have in spades.\\n\\nJared Padalecki And Genevieve Cortese\\n\\nJared Padalecki has had a pretty long and steady career on television, and he's even had the chance to work with his future wife.\\n\\nPadalecki and Genevieve Cortese actually met on the set of Supernatural when Cortese was a recurring guest during the show's fourth season. Cortese played Ruby, a demon who seduces Padalecki's character and causes a rift to form between Sam and Dean.\\n\\nAlthough the affair between Sam and Ruby proved to be short-lived, Padalecki and Cortese's relationship turned out to be a pretty stable one. The couple eventually got married, and they now live in Austin, Texas with their three children. Supernatural is a show with plenty of tragedy, but things seemed to have ended in a happily ever after for Padalecki and Cortese.\\n\\nAly And AJ Michalka\\n\\nAly and AJ Michalka have been famous since a fairly young age. Both actresses made their debuts on the Disney Channel when they were still quite young, and they also to\"},\"executed\":true,\"next_start\":3000,\"ok\":true,\"previously_received\":false}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_3cb7283aa154475e8d5a8736"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d45\"},\"ref\":\"d45\",\"snippet\":\" ... That's when her acting career really hit the heights with the movie Goodbye, Columbus (alongside Jack Klugman) and movie Love Story. A few years later, in 1973, she would marry actor Steve McQueen.\\n\\nMORE: From model to movie star, Ali MacGraw was Hollywood's unstoppable heroine (1972 ... \",\"title\":\"https://clickamericana.com/topics/celebrities-famous-people/model-to-actor-before-they-were-famous\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d46\"},\"ref\":\"d46\",\"snippet\":\" ... Robert Caldwell on the series St. Elsewhere in 1983. Harmon appeared in the show for almost three seasons before leaving in early 1986 when his character contracted HIV through unprotected intercourse, one of the first instances where a major recurring television character contracted the virus (the character's ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Harmon\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the world of The 100.\\n\\nJessica plays Niylah, a character who shows up in ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d47\"},\"ref\":\"d47\",\"snippet\":\" ... Characters\\n\\nMajor characters\\n\\n* John Harmon – is heir to the Harmon estate, under the condition that he marry Bella Wilfer. He is presumed dead throughout most of the novel, though he is living under the name John Rokesmith, and working as a secretary for the Boffins in an attempt ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Our_Mutual_Friend\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d48\"},\"ref\":\"d48\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the 1962–1963 season he appeared in two episodes of Leave It to Beaver, cast as Mike Harmon, a friend of Beaver's. In 1962, Matheson also appeared in the CBS situation comedy My Three Sons. In 1964, he provided the voice of the lead character in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tim_Matheson\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d49\"},\"ref\":\"d49\",\"snippet\":\" ... They worked so well together, they formed their own successful duo, and as Captain and Tennille, quickly reached number one on the \\\"Billboard\\\" Hot 100 with \\\"Love Will Keep Us Together,\\\" which also earned the Grammy for Record of the Year for 1975. The two married and had ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/best-musical-duos-ever/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d50\"},\"ref\":\"d50\",\"snippet\":\" ... Saheem Ali (Sugar in our Wounds) directs the MTC debut of Jeff Augustin's (Little Children Dream of God) newest play.\\n\\nThe Height of the Storm\\n\\nFINAL PERFORMANCE WAS November 24th, 2019\\n\\nFor 50 years the lives of André and Madeleine have been filled with the everyday pleasures ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.manhattantheatreclub.com/past-productions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... Arnholt was born April 5, 1948 in Toledo, Ohio to Richard and Virginia (Gerkensmyer) Arnholt. Mike married Rosemary Boyle on May 31, 1975 in Plymouth, MI.\\n\\nThe long-time journalist earned a B