ed\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... I find that Richard Harmon has given depth to his character and shows great comedy skills too. Davida Williams was perfect. She is so much in the character. I really loved her work and the chemistry the leads get to build between their characters. This Is a process ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt20116668/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d76\"},\"ref\":\"d76\",\"snippet\":\" ... And the bitterness followed Chase so closely that Harmon had him booted from the show after that season! Per Deadline, tensions had been high between Chase and Harmon for a while as the production of the third season got into the swing of things. That included multiple prior ... \",\"title\":\"https://listverse.com/2024/10/15/10-actors-who-infamously-stormed-off-set-while-filming/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d77\"},\"ref\":\"d77\",\"snippet\":\" ... Harmon admits. \\\"My job was to say yes.\\\" Choosing a song by the 88 was also meaningful to Harmon because the character of Britta (Gillian Jacobs) was partially inspired by a \\\"super hip\\\" ex-girlfriend who introduced him to the band years earlier. \\\"Even just hearing [the song ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/tv/best-tv-theme-songs-21st-century/?srsltid=AfmBOooiefkeit4W3-Grk9msaAyUN4mDjUZ6MZvYMhGe2ByJjr6DKKtz\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d78\"},\"ref\":\"d78\",\"snippet\":\" ... It was also the home of the Comedy Central television series The Meltdown with Jonah & Kumail. Past performers include Louis C.K., Jim Gaffigan, Dan Harmon, Kumail Nanjiani, Jonah Ray, and Robin Williams.\\n\\nThe Showroom closed with Meltdown on March 31, 2018, after the building's owners sold ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nerdist\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\" ... We the 100 Million\\\"\\n\\nDirector/Producer: Jason R.A. Foster\\n\\nProducer: Michael \\\"Quess?\\\" Moore, Jeremy Liu\\n\\nMexico, USA | 2021 | 1 hr 9 min | 13+\\n\\nFriday, Oct. 22 10:30am Wilke\\n\\n\\\"Many Fires This Time: We the 100 Million\\\" is a poetic docudrama about the 1 in 3 Americans ... \",\"title\":\"https://tallgrassfilm.org/2021-lineup/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"74f0a132e4880233983568347ee0ba206f058dac744609b9bc072d9ee0aea3b9\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"a2dd7085c36f40a485023f73c7c5e9498721271663bc9c3138c3a42e92e13f4f\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Niylah The 100 Jessica Harmon character\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d80\"},\"ref\":\"d80\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sharon Murphy described the claim as \\\"a smear\\\".\\n\\nBrittany Murphy Foundation\\n\\nIn January 2010, Murphy's mother, Sharon, and her widower, Simon Monjack, established the Brittany Murphy Foundation, a charitable fund for children's arts education, as well as supporting the USO and cancer research.\\n\\nThe Foundation was ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brittany_Murphy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d81\"},\"ref\":\"d81\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Murphys are the Garveys' neighbors in Jarden.\\n*Kevin Carroll as John Murphy (seasons 2–3), Erika's husband and head of Jarden's volunteer fire department. He subsequently marries Laurie, and operates as a fraudulent medium.\\n*Jovan Adepo as Michael Murphy (seasons 2–3), Erika and John ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Leftovers_(TV_series)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d82\"},\"ref\":\"d82\",\"snippet\":\" ... Marilyn Monroe, Natalie Wood and Brittany Murphy are talked about just as much for their controversial deaths as they are for their bodies of work. Thelma Todd died under suspicious circumstances in 1935; almost 100 years later, people continue to speculate about what really happened to the young ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/tragic-deaths-actresses/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d83\"},\"ref\":\"d83\",\"snippet\":\" ... Further theatre and film roles\\n\\nMurphy returned to the stage starring opposite Neve Campbell at the New Ambassadors Theatre in London's West End from November 2006 to February 2007, playing the lead role of John Kolvenbach's play Love Song. Theatre Record described his character of Beane ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cillian_Murphy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d84\"},\"ref\":\"d84\",\"snippet\":\" ... Personal life\\n\\nBrosnan has married twice, having been widowed once, and has five children and four grandchildren. He met Australian actress Cassandra Harris through David Harris, the nephew of Richard Harris, shortly after leaving drama school. On meeting her, he said, \\\"What a beautiful-looking woman. I never ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierce_Brosnan\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d85\"},\"ref\":\"d85\",\"snippet\":\" ... Not only was it originally a high-concept sci-fi, but movie star Eddie Murphy was meant to have a meaty part alongside John Belushi and Dan Aykroyd. (The movie was basically meant for SNL guys to have some laughs catching ghosts.)\\n\\nMurphy passed on the gig, deciding ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.gamesradar.com/32-actors-who-turned-down-iconic-roles/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... Eddie Murphy was in full control at this point, starkly evident in Coming to America's John Landis' coasting direction.\\n\\nSynopsis: Prince Akeem (Eddie Murphy) is the prince of a wealthy African country and wants for nothing, except a wife who [More]\\n\\nDirected By:\\n\\nJohn Landis\\n\\n#129\\n\\nCritics ... \",\"title\":\"https://editorial.rottentomatoes.com/guide/140-favorite-80s-movies/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... ve Lost Through the Years\\nauthor: John Russell\\ndate: 2025-02-16\\n---\\nSince its 1975 premiere, Saturday Night Live has featured more than 100 cast members, many of whom have gone on to become major stars in their own right. Think Chevy Chase, Eddie Murphy, Adam Sandler, Tina ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/saturday-night-live-stars-who-have-died-9257836\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"328843620bc2f06ebcd32b03bd74bfcd62abee5d0beac5cd88